From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AX23_V2_OPENWRT <ax23-v2-openwrt@users.noreply.invalid>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 15:22:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] uboot-envtools: qualcommax: add Archer AX23 v2

The environment layout is taken from TP-Link's GPL U-Boot for this board
(GPL_AX23v2.tar.gz, u-boot-2016): CONFIG_ENV_IS_IN_NAND with
CONFIG_ENV_SIZE = CONFIG_ENV_SIZE_MAX = 256 KiB at the start of the
0:APPSBLENV partition (board_init.c: board_env_offset = first block of
that partition), 128 KiB erase blocks. This matches the existing
Archer AX55 v1 entry.

This makes 'fw_printenv tp_boot_idx' usable for read-only diagnostics.
sysupgrade stays refused on this board, so nothing in the image writes
the environment.
---
 package/boot/uboot-tools/uboot-envtools/files/qualcommax_ipq50xx | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/package/boot/uboot-tools/uboot-envtools/files/qualcommax_ipq50xx b/package/boot/uboot-tools/uboot-envtools/files/qualcommax_ipq50xx
index ed506968f3..8bb5d2964c 100644
--- a/package/boot/uboot-tools/uboot-envtools/files/qualcommax_ipq50xx
+++ b/package/boot/uboot-tools/uboot-envtools/files/qualcommax_ipq50xx
@@ -21,6 +21,7 @@ zyxel,scr50axe)
 	ubootenv_add_mtd "0:appsblenv" "0x0" "0x40000" "0x20000"
 	;;
 glinet,gl-b3000|\
+tplink,archer-ax23-v2|\
 tplink,archer-ax55-v1|\
 tplink,eap650-outdoor-v1)
 	ubootenv_add_mtd "0:APPSBLENV" "0x0" "0x40000" "0x20000"
